      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense but if i actually want to see a massive drop in overhead, i'm probably gonna have to let some people go as the ai takes over their roles. it's just better for the bottom line. how do i handle the transition so it doesn't look like i'm just mass firing people once the tech is ready?",
