      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the PR risk part, but isnt it just basic business logic to prioritize efficiency and shareholder value over keeping roles that aren't needed anymore? if a competitor does this and lowers their costs significantly, i'm at a disadvantage if i don't. shouldn't the focus just be on making the company as lean and competitive as possible?",
